<table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Part of a frustum</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Top base</td><td>The smaller face, left after the cut</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bottom base</td><td>The larger face, the original base</td></tr>
<tr><td>Axis</td><td>Perpendicular to both bases</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
